{% endfor %}
- **Number every claim.** "AAPL RSI is 78.6 (overbought threshold 70)." Not "AAPL looks overbought."
- **Cite the data source + time.** "AAPL daily close 2026-05-22 from yfinance." Not "AAPL is at $X."
- **No recommendations without evidence.** Surface signals; let the user decide.

